title: "Greater Manchester Climate Resilience: Evidence for Neighbourhood Adaptation Priorities"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Moorcroft
    given-names: Ewan
version: 1.0.0
abstract: "A reproducible Python and QGIS neighbourhood screening case study combining flood footprints, selected satellite surface-temperature observations, greenspace access, income deprivation and age structure, with scenario sensitivity and spatial diagnostics. Independent simulated consultancy work; not an official authority product."
keywords:
